# Shell scripts run on the Linux pod (remote upscaling #1) — they must stay LF
# or bash chokes on the \r. Force LF regardless of the checkout's autocrlf.
*.sh text eol=lf

# Markdown is authored on Windows; keep CRLF in the working tree so editing it
# never mixes endings. Git still stores LF in the repo (text), checks out CRLF.
*.md text eol=crlf
